   },
   {
    "quote": "On September 30, 2026, Kobayashi Pharmaceutical released \"Gyulac\" (a drug requiring pharmacist guidance), a medication to improve recurrent symptoms of Irritable Bowel Syndrome (IBS). It is being introduced as a new option for \"recurring diarrhea and constipation\" caused by stress and anxiety.",
    "url": "https://note.com/katamimi_ns_kawa/n/nbebe2df72854?hl=en",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "For me, having been diagnosed with IBS, this was quite big news.",
